Why This Matters for Cyber Professionals
Password security is fundamental to cybersecurity:

Data Breaches: When databases are compromised, hashed passwords protect users
Compliance: Regulations like GDPR require secure password storage
Professional Practice: All production systems must use proper password hashing
Career Skills: Understanding bcrypt, salting, and hashing is essential for security roles
Key Takeaways
Never store plain text passwords: Always use cryptographic hashing
Always use salt: Prevents rainbow table and dictionary attacks
Use proven libraries: bcrypt is industry-standard and battle-tested
One-way function: Hashes cannot be reversed to get original password
